?",answer:"Absolutely. We ensure compliance with data privacy laws and global AI ethics frameworks.",category:"AI Advisory Services",keywords:["ethical","legal","support","compliance","privacy","laws","ethics"],icon:"⚖️"},{question:"Can you build AI tools for government projects?",answer:"Yes. We design and develop AI tools for automation, data analysis, and decision-making support.",category:"AI Solution Development",keywords:["build","tools","develop","government","projects","automation","analysis"],icon:"🛠️"},{question:"Are your AI solutions customizable?",answer:"Yes, our solutions are tailored to the specific needs and challenges of departments or use cases.",category:"AI Solution Development",keywords:["customizable","tailored","custom","solutions","specific","needs"],icon:"⚙️"},{question:"Do you test the tools before full-scale use?",answer:"Every solution is validated for effectiveness and accuracy before deployment.",category:"AI Solution Development",keywords:["test","testing","validation","pilot","deployment","quality"],icon:"✅"},{question:"Do you offer AI training programs?",answer:"Yes. We offer comprehensive upskilling programs for government officials and employees.",category:"AI Upskilling",keywords:["training","programs","upskilling","learn","courses","education"],icon:"📚"},{question:"Who can enroll in AI training?",answer:"Our training is primarily for public sector staff, but we also collaborate with institutions for broader learning initiatives.",category:"AI Upskilling",keywords:["enroll","who","join","participate","eligibility","public sector"],icon:"👨‍🎓"},{question:"Are these programs certified?",answer:"Yes, many of our training programs are partnered with recognized institutions and offer certification.",category:"AI Upskilling",keywords:["certified","certificate","certification","accredited","recognized"],icon:"🎓"},{question:"How can I partner with the Karnataka AI Cell?",answer:"Reach out via our collaboration portal or contact form. We work with academia, startups, corporates, and researchers.",category:"AI Collaboration",keywords:["partner","collaboration","collaborate","work together","join","partnership"],icon:"🤝"},{question:"Do you work with startups?",answer:"Definitely. We actively collaborate with AI startups on solutions, innovation challenges, and ecosystem-building.",category:"AI Collaboration",keywords:["startups","startup","entrepreneur","innovation","ecosystem"],icon:"🚀"},{question:"What kind of support do collaborators receive?",answer:"We provide technical mentorship, policy support, visibility, and sometimes co-development opportunities.",category:"AI Collaboration",keywords:["support","help","mentorship","assistance","benefits","receive"],icon:"🎁"},{question:"Is there an official AI policy for Karnataka?",answer:"We are actively working on it and will be publishing the Karnataka AI policy soon.",category:"AI Policy & Ethics",keywords:["policy","official","karnataka","document","guidelines"],icon:"📜"},{question:"Where can I read the AI policy?",answer:"You can access the full policy document on our website under the 'Knowledge & Governance Hub' or 'AI Policy' section once it's published.",category:"AI Policy & Ethics",keywords:["read","access","find","policy","document","where"],icon:"📖"},{question:"How does Karnataka ensure ethical AI?",answer:"We follow principles of transparency, accountability, data protection, and fairness in all AI initiatives.",category:"AI Policy & Ethics",keywords:["ethical","ensure","principles","transparency","accountability","fairness"],icon:"🛡️"}],je=Array.from(new Set(le.map(T=>T.category))),Ie=["Need help? Click me!","I'm here to assist!","Let's chat! 💬","Ask me anything","How can I help?","Try me! 😊"],De=T=>{const O=T.toLowerCase().trim();if(/^(hi|hello|hey|hola|greetings|good\s*(morning|afternoon|evening))/.test(O))return"Hello! 👋 I'm the Karnataka AI Cell assistant. Browse through the questions below or type your own question. How can I assist you t